{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Dog</strong> is a pixel-art stealth Metroidvania that blends action, exploration, and tactical infiltration. You play as a canine samurai returning for revenge, slipping through a world of light and shadow using abilities like <strong>Shadow Clone</strong> and <strong>Shadow Blink</strong> to outwit enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38A City Built on Light and Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides danger\u2014or opportunity. Sneak past patrols, manipulate light sources, and use environmental sounds to lure enemies away. Choose between silent infiltration or stylish combat. Your playstyle defines your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Dynamic Stealth Mechanics</strong><br>Light defines visibility. Enemies can only see illuminated areas. Hide in shadows, crouch behind cover, disable lights, or distract guards with sound and trickery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf11 Shadow Clone &amp; Blink Abilities</strong><br>Unlock powerful skills to navigate complex traps and outmaneuver enemies. Send your clone into danger or blink behind enemies before they even notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Metroidvania Exploration</strong><br>Non-linear maps with ability-gated progression. Unlock shortcuts, discover hidden paths, and dive into secret challenge rooms filled with risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Strategic Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses with distinct mechanics\u2014some lurk in darkness, others summon illusions or use deadly traps. Each encounter is a battle of wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Handcrafted Pixel Art &amp; Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world by veteran pixel artists, where delicate performance animations breathe life into the characters, presenting a unique Eastern dog-knight aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/ba6e7046395814f927a4a22bdafabf6c.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\ud83d\udcd6 Immersive Animal Fable</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/79c2330f15a124ca5dcc99ba7d0dd8ba.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1526 height=434 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a beastly society echoing human flaws, filled with symbolism and poetic tragedy. Piece together the hero\u2019s mysterious past and uncover a story of revenge, loss, and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/256f3fc13515cce7a1e3fbefcb3c8ac0.avif?t=1766472654\" width=890 height=910 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686990?t=1766472654","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3686990?t=1766472654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/ac081907c74fb64cf939e249acdc96e272633271/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766472654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/ac081907c74fb64cf939e249acdc96e272633271/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766472654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains stylized violence and combat, including stealth kills and the use of weapons. While there is no graphic gore or nudity, the story involves themes of revenge, betrayal, and death that may not be suitable for all players."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dead Dog</strong> is a pixel-art stealth Metroidvania that blends action, exploration, and tactical infiltration. You play as a canine samurai returning for revenge, slipping through a world of light and shadow using abilities like <strong>Shadow Clone</strong> and <strong>Shadow Blink</strong> to outwit enemies, solve puzzles, and survive deadly encounters.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38A City Built on Light and Shadow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every corner hides danger\u2014or opportunity. Sneak past patrols, manipulate light sources, and use environmental sounds to lure enemies away. Choose between silent infiltration or stylish combat. Your playstyle defines your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd38Core Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f Dynamic Stealth Mechanics</strong><br>Light defines visibility. Enemies can only see illuminated areas. Hide in shadows, crouch behind cover, disable lights, or distract guards with sound and trickery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/58ce995605711f3c2e2f371f5e645081.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf11 Shadow Clone &amp; Blink Abilities</strong><br>Unlock powerful skills to navigate complex traps and outmaneuver enemies. Send your clone into danger or blink behind enemies before they even notice you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/db499834d04ce73d43b393303d869a2a.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Metroidvania Exploration</strong><br>Non-linear maps with ability-gated progression. Unlock shortcuts, discover hidden paths, and dive into secret challenge rooms filled with risk and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/d87ff343c0e225faed3fc0e10a1b8d4d.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc3a Strategic Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against unique bosses with distinct mechanics\u2014some lurk in darkness, others summon illusions or use deadly traps. Each encounter is a battle of wits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.poster.avif?t=1766472654\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.webm?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686990/extras/b0478640a13739d342c7aaa2c22c8a28.mp4?t=1766472654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Handcrafted Pixel Art &amp; Animation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A hand-crafted world by veteran pixel artists, where delicate performance animations breathe life into the characters, presenting a unique Eastern dog-knight aesthetic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i